              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo maalin walba iyagoo isku wada qalbi ah ayay macbudka ku jiri jireen, oo kibistana guryahooday ku jejebin jireen, cuntadoodana farxad iyo qalbi daacad ah ayay ku cuni jireen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
